{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mq75a815","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/cloude","title":"[ingest] Bearer-token auth is opt-in, default-deny allowlist when set","summary":"Auth is off by default (back-compat: no token ⇒ every endpoint open). When ORCH_TOKEN / token-file is set it is a default-deny allowlist: writes (/mcp, /reset, /overlay/*, loop control) require it, reads stay open. Set it whenever exposing the daemon beyond localhost.","created_by":"ingest","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-10T19:01:05.747Z"}
